From 1245e84d10ebedca1e1e8c67dd3a71094303125f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 14:06:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chore: add worker-factory/Vault vars to .env.example
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Follow-up to ba7c5a6 — src/config.ts added ENABLE_UPCLOUD_WORKER_FACTORY,
UPCLOUD_BROKER_URL, UPCLOUD_BROKER_API_KEY, WORKER_SESSION_DEFAULT_TTL_MS,
WORKER_SESSION_MAX_TTL_MS, WORKER_POOL_WARM_SIZE, VAULT_ADDR, VAULT_ROLE_ID,
VAULT_SECRET_ID, VAULT_SECRET_MOUNT but .env.example was not updated to
match, which AGENTS.md's own PR checklist requires.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NaMrQ4NGni9rU7GmSqSg5E
---
 .env.example | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.env.example b/.env.example
index 859604a..2049e8f 100644
--- a/.env.example
+++ b/.env.example
@@ -100,6 +100,27 @@ ENABLE_RUNTIME_HEALTH_RECOVERY=true
 REDIS_URL=
 # Example: REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
 
+# =========================================================
+# UpCloud Worker Factory (ephemeral browser/desktop sessions)
+# Only required when ENABLE_UPCLOUD_WORKER_FACTORY=true
+# See docs/gates/upcloud-worker-factory.md for the full contract
+# =========================================================
+ENABLE_UPCLOUD_WORKER_FACTORY=false
+UPCLOUD_BROKER_URL=
+UPCLOUD_BROKER_API_KEY=
+WORKER_SESSION_DEFAULT_TTL_MS=900000
+WORKER_SESSION_MAX_TTL_MS=3600000
+WORKER_POOL_WARM_SIZE=0
+
+# =========================================================
+# HashiCorp Vault (dynamic secret leasing for worker sessions)
+# Only required when ENABLE_UPCLOUD_WORKER_FACTORY=true
+# =========================================================
+VAULT_ADDR=
+VAULT_ROLE_ID=
+VAULT_SECRET_ID=
+VAULT_SECRET_MOUNT=secret
+
 # =========================================================
 # Observability
 # =========================================================
